    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Help Myko complete her entrance exam for the Royal Academy's School of Mycology by finding and cataloguing each of the mushrooms in her Exam Journal. Myko's journal is a puzzle that you must solve to figure out the when and where of a dynamic mushroom growth system. Time only moves when you decide to travel, and <i>you</i> get to choose when and how Myko completes her journey. Enjoy a self-paced cozy journey through natural landscapes while foraging for mushrooms and meeting kind characters along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find 80 unique  mushrooms that dynamically grow based on day, time, and location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with a colorful cast of helpful characters, each of which have their own tiny stories  to tell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research found mushrooms to add their unique information to Myko's journal and complete the puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send away extra mushrooms to the local village to help with daily requests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit three charming landscapes each with their own set of mushrooms, characters, and locations to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibe in the coziness of nature with a calming playlist of new music.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Help Myko complete her entrance exam for the Royal Academy's School of Mycology by finding and cataloguing each of the mushrooms in her Exam Journal. Myko's journal is a puzzle that you must solve to figure out the when and where of a dynamic mushroom growth system. Time only moves when you decide to travel, and <i>you</i> get to choose when and how Myko completes her journey. Enjoy a self-paced cozy journey through natural landscapes while foraging for mushrooms and meeting kind characters along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find 80 unique  mushrooms that dynamically grow based on day, time, and location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with a colorful cast of helpful characters, each of which have their own tiny stories  to tell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research found mushrooms to add their unique information to Myko's journal and complete the puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send away extra mushrooms to the local village to help with daily requests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit three charming landscapes each with their own set of mushrooms, characters, and locations to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibe in the coziness of nature with a calming playlist of new music.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Help Myko complete her mushroom foraging journal and get into the Royal Academy in this cozy, self-paced adventure game. Meet a colorful cast of characters in calm natural spaces as you uncover the gentle puzzle of mycology.",
